{"product_id":"angels-dont-know-karate-the-adventures-of-the-bailey-school-kids-23","title":"Angels Don't Know Karate (The Adventures Of The Bailey School Kids #23)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe hugely popular early chapter book series re-emerges with a new look! Brand-new eye-catching cover art brings a modern feel to this classic monster series for young readers.Melody believes in guardian angels, but the other Bailey School kids aren't convinced. That is until a new woman comes to town who keeps showing up just in time to save people. Melody even says she saw the woman spreading her wings! Could the newcomer really have come to Bailey City on a miracle mission?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 133 x 197\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Debbie Dadey\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780590849029\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 80\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45898399318169,"sku":"17RE-2-9780590849029","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/71ClmLInO4L._AC_UF1000_1000_QL80.jpg?v=1763204110","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/angels-dont-know-karate-the-adventures-of-the-bailey-school-kids-23","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}